cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this resource, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DSP to AI: From Signal Processing to Deep Learning"
abstract: >-
  An interactive educational website bridging classical Digital Signal
  Processing with modern AI. 27 chapters and 51 interactive tools trace the
  path from signals, convolution and IIR filters to attention, state-space
  models and Mamba, and then examine where the analogies hold and where they
  break.
authors:
